    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapist or whatever... they just want to help me \"cope\" so i can keep doing this same thing every single day. they dont get it. there is no \"managing\" this. it's just constant. sometimes i look at my bed and i just think... what if i just didn't wake up? like, if i could just sleep through all of this and never have to deal with the noise or the sickness or the weight again. that honestly sounds more peaceful than anything else right now.",
